OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdry this evening and overnight, with
OL,7,Fclear spells for many. It will always
OL,8,Fbe a little cloudier across Scotland,
OL,9,Fwith an increased chance of a shower
OL,10,Fin the far northwest. Fog patches in
OL,11,Fthe west and turning quite chilly.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA chilly start across the
OL,14,Fnorth, but another fine and dry day
OL,15,Ffor many. Skies turning hazy across
OL,16,FDevon and Cornwall during the
OL,17,Fafternoon with an increased chance of
OL,18,Fshowers.
